## Reviewer got wrong (not applied)

nb-a row 2. The shared URL is the Business Tax Act (pcode G0340028, flno=3). Korean 004 and English 004 name that act’s article 10 (영업세법 제10조 / Article 10 of the Value-Added and Non-Value-Added Business Tax Act). The reviewer’s rewrite would relabel it as the nonresident dividend-withholding rule because 001’s Norwegian caption follows a different Korean caption on the same URL. That would contradict the English source and the statute code. The URL and the article number were not changed.

